{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1cd78d2be633145878a670eebcdc986c7beedb489f0b955486aeb547a6c5950f","ja":"『恋の呪文』はどんなもの？","zh":"『恋之咒语』是什么样的？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e489e9c666ab5a64f22bda1fa038d725a0adaf8e4f1b57b06341caccf2fa7c18","ja":"「悠久の眠りより目覚めし真美よ、\n今こそ大いなるせくちーを解き放て～！」","zh":"「自悠久的沉睡中苏醒的真美啊，\n正是此刻，释放那伟大的性感吧～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4d9da08aaea67a1f47e6d242a16087976ebf15137dacbfe6f77fa55c046d5113","ja":"うん、バッチリっしょ♪\n真美はこれでいこーっと！","zh":"嗯，很完美吧♪\n真美就选这个啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"700a836c4783c4e91b16bc13fbcbf019b70cccbdf0024a3d9dd3c2e092359543","ja":"「ふんわか、ほんわか、ぴろぴろりん♪」\n……あれ、さっきとちがうかも？　まあいっか～♪","zh":"“轻飘飘、暖洋洋、哔咯哔咯哩♪”\n……咦，好像跟刚才不太一样？嘛，无所谓啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1c85fdb4669704438dece95d9ef718dc571c77803626db4ca26ad484bf4c4423","ja":"真美ちゃんと麗花さんも、もう決まったんですね。\nわたしはどうしようかな～……？","zh":"真美和丽花小姐也已经决定好了呢。\n我该怎么办好呢～……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1848ea5fdb2ddd0dba862307e0d07b4071393d4c45918865a65fc8e869e42cd8","ja":"（恋の呪文、恋の呪文……うーん\nみんなが喜んでくれる呪文……）","zh":"（恋爱的咒语，恋爱的咒语……唔——\n能让大家都开心的咒语……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d4e2baf95b42ecf5e188cca6e24fd3213f7b42c67280aa9dc9007f91016a24fb","ja":"「5分後、本番お願いしまーす！」","zh":"“5分钟后正式开演，请多关照——！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ed6c441b5fc4a5bd21bac36c145a231826e4a62a5e8b2cb9dd066bf2dab22b0f","ja":"えっ！　もうそんな時間ですか～？\nええっと……。","zh":"咦！　已经到这个时间了吗～？\n那个……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"93b06050d49eff4d87f3d9b6a60f05b8657fd105fa9793792f648e4453de203c","ja":"そんなに考えなくても大丈夫だよ♪　翼ちゃんなら\nきっと、自然に『恋の呪文』がかけられるから♪","zh":"不用考虑那么多也没关系的♪　如果是翼的话，\n肯定能自然地施展出“恋之咒语”的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e0b204a28afd1f4e5423bd4c1d0c6c13b4f0ac951d5e8d624c8b0cdfbe7fbf44","ja":"うむ！　心に思い浮かんだ言葉をそのまま唱えれば、\nそれすなわち呪文なり～。","zh":"嗯！只要照着心中浮现的话语念出来，\n那就等同于咒语啦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1f0d8cf3b07959c5bc5a17cee4ba9e152d258d8bc2356ea0e3f98e9de55c4269","ja":"自然に、思い浮かんだこと……。","zh":"自然而然想到的事……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a9d8509cc6a5904e3b95f4883f82dd81a9f22f8bf85ce327d4d048840b75a399","ja":"あっ、わかっちゃったかも♪","zh":"啊，我可能知道了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"2cb1f35a9b3e2458a69153a73fcaed34363af21c9d05b648e0d4cbebf5df0003","ja":"そして収録は進み……","zh":"然后录制继续进行……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"8b992cdf1f11e3834d21a5146f05b5ca13c4d95055436646599577090d5c267a","ja":"じゃあ、ラストはわたしが『恋の呪文』を\n唱えちゃいますね！　いきますよ～？","zh":"那么，最后就由我来念出\n“恋爱的咒语”吧！准备好了吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1099.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"9e2fdd50493c18589a36eb922eb11f228472ec415d977d43d66276971655033a","ja":"「……みんながドキドキしちゃう\nわたしにな～れっ♪」","zh":"「……变成能让大家\n心动不已的我吧～♪」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
